//[user 2026-09-03] DECAPITATION ASSETS. Sentient::SetBloodModel already CacheResources three of
//these on the actor spawn path, and it is measurably not enough: this map's logs carry the engine's
//own "Add the following line to the *_precache.scr map script" warning for each of them, printed at
//the moment of a decap - i.e. the TIKI is loading from disk inside the hero frame. Two of these are
//on the coop_rampDecapMark path (the neck cap and the gore props); the other two are the death-
//kinetics blob set, which this map already loads late today and which cost one line each to fix.
cache models/fx/coop_stump_neck.tik
cache models/fx/coop_wound1.tik
cache models/fx/coop_headgib.tik
cache models/fx/coop_gorechunk.tik
//(models/fx/coop_blooddrip.tik is already cached by coop_mod/precache.scr:179)
